`,l.jsx(t.p,{children:"At first glance, these requirements are fairly simple but don't seem compatible."}),`
`,l.jsx(t.p,{children:"GitHub Pages on the free tier only serves websites from public repositories. My initial thought was that I'd have to choose between making my repository public or buying a domain."}),`
`,l.jsx(t.p,{children:"Turns out, that's not the tradeoff."}),`
`,l.jsx(t.p,{children:"The solution is to stop thinking of your website repository as the thing that gets deployed. Instead, treat it like any other software project."}),`
