`,l.jsx(t.p,{children:"The key realization: GitHub Pages doesn't care about your project. It only serves static files."}),`
`,l.jsx(t.p,{children:"The source repository stays private forever. The public repository only contains generated artifacts. The private repository holds everything involved in development: source code, drafts, assets, build configuration, commit history, CI workflows."}),`
`,l.jsx(t.p,{children:"From GitHub Pages' perspective, that's all it ever needed."}),`
